            "id": "q1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "marks": 1,
            "question": "The rationalizing factor of $\\sqrt[3]{4}$ is",
            "options": [
                "$\\sqrt[3]{2}$",
                "$\\sqrt[3]{4}$",
                "$\\sqrt[3]{16}$",
                "2"
            ],
            "finalAnswer": "(a) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$",
            "solutionSteps": [
                "Rationalizing factor is such that product is a rational number.",
                "$\\sqrt[3]{4} \\times \\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$.",
                "So, $\\sqrt[3]{2}$ is the rationalizing factor."
            ]
        },
