            "finalAnswer": "(c) $\\sqrt{7}$",
            "solutionSteps": [
                "$\\sqrt{4/9} = 2/3$ (Rational)",
                "$\\sqrt{12}/\\sqrt{3} = \\sqrt{4} = 2$ (Rational)",
                "$\\sqrt{7}$ cannot be simplified to $p/q$ form where $p,q$ are integers (Irrational)",
                "$\\sqrt{81} = 9$ (Rational)"
            ]
