            "finalAnswer": "233/990",
            "solutionSteps": [
                "Let $x = 0.2353535\\dots$",
                "Multiply by 10: $10x = 2.353535\\dots$ (i)",
                "Multiply by 1000: $1000x = 235.353535\\dots$ (ii)",
                "Subtract (i) from (ii): $990x = 233$.",
                "So, $x = 233/990$."
            ]
